% TR-059 (Hattori, Yokoi, "The Concepts and Facilities of SIMPOS File System", ICOT TR-059, 84.04)
% PDF page 27, printed folio 25. Section 4.3(2) 'Linking a volume'.
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi code-line crops (work/tr0059/m*.png), F2 2026-11-23. Courier font: punctuation clear.
% Bullet descriptions ('o To ...') are given as % comments; only the indented code lines are printed code.

% o To link a volume into a directory system
             :link(Volume,Pathname)
% "For example, the operation"
      :link(Volume,">disk1>volume1")
% "associates the root directory file of 'Volume' with the pathname ">disk1>volume1". Then, a file
%  with the name "dir1>filename1" on this volume is retrieved by"
      :retrieve(Object,">disk1>volume1>dir1>filename1")
% (as printed: :retrieve with two arguments, no #as_global_object receiver; not corrected)
